🔄 How it works:
   1. Judge issues AMEND verdict with feedback
   2. extract_judge_feedback() parses the feedback
   3. run_revision_step() uses feedback to improve FR
   4. commit_revision_attempt() saves the revision
   5. Judge re-evaluates the revised FR
   6. Loop repeats up to 2 times if still AMEND
   7. If exhausted, calls handle_failure as before

🚫 Before FR-286: AMEND → immediate handle_failure
✅ After FR-286:  AMEND → revision cycle → eventual success or failure
